# ROG N-Key keyboard (G16): start g16-winlockd for its hidraw nodes. No access is
# granted: the nodes stay root-only and the service is the only reader. The tag
# stays on change events too, or systemd would drop the device unit the service binds to.
SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ACTION!="remove", ATTRS{idVendor}=="0b05", ATTRS{idProduct}=="19b6", TAG+="systemd", ENV{SYSTEMD_WANTS}+="g16-winlockd@%k.service"
